    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a pause. it feels like the end. like the story just ran out of pages and there's nothing left to write. there's just this edge, and the silence waiting below. it feels almost... right. like it's supposed to be this way.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
